  "summary_text": "Ownership question and monorepo tooling and code owners file\nNo clear owner for ownership question\nMonorepo tooling is ahead of where i expected\nMonorepo tooling is more of a people problem\nCode owners file is not where i'd want it\nPreference to get more data rather than look at it with fresh eyes\nScope and timeline and service boundaries\nScope is the obvious next thing\nConcern with timeline: the dependencies on other teams\nReal issue may be incident review rather than service boundaries\nOriginal proposal and read replicas and dependency upgrade\nOriginal proposal is unclear\nRead replicas: it seems to come and go\nConcern with dependency upgrade: that we lose context\nProgress updates\nDone: write up the August outage review (Alex)\nDone: draft the new on-call rotation (Alex)\nDone: get the Otter beta onto TestFlight (Inês)\nNext steps\nMegan to ship the new pricing page by Wednesday\nSam to fix the double-charge retry bug by Wednesday",
  "summary_markdown": "### Ownership question and monorepo tooling and code owners file\n- No clear owner for ownership question\n- Monorepo tooling is ahead of where i expected\n  - Monorepo tooling is more of a people problem\n- Code owners file is not where i'd want it\n- Preference to get more data rather than look at it with fresh eyes\n\n### Scope and timeline and service boundaries\n- Scope is the obvious next thing\n- Concern with timeline: the dependencies on other teams\n- Real issue may be incident review rather than service boundaries\n\n### Original proposal and read replicas and dependency upgrade\n- Original proposal is unclear\n- Read replicas: it seems to come and go\n- Concern with dependency upgrade: that we lose context\n\n### Progress updates\n- **Done:** write up the August outage review (Alex)\n- **Done:** draft the new on-call rotation (Alex)\n- **Done:** get the Otter beta onto TestFlight (Inês)\n\n### Next steps\n- Megan to ship the new pricing page by **Wednesday**\n- Sam to fix the double-charge retry bug by **Wednesday**",
  "private_notes_text": "done write up the august outage review (alex)\nmegan to ship the new pricing page by",
