    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "To be fair, I'd rather get more data than look at it with fresh eyes, at least for now. Plus for this, I think the CI pipeline is the part that's kind of stuck. Honestly the alerting thresholds only needs three weeks if we set up a short sync. Mm, I keep coming back to the config drift, for what it's worth. So I'm kind of torn about the deploy freeze, like kind of. From my side, I don't know if requirements is really the issue, I think",
