        "name": "Sam Patel"
      },
      "text": "Okay yeah, the handoff came up this morning too, I don't know. I'm more positive about the load test, anyway. From my side, the annoying thing about the batch size is it's a little behind. So the annoying thing about the rate limiter is it's in a weird spot. Like, we've been saying we'd map out the edge cases for a while, at least for now. It's like, the dead letter queue is like the easy part and nobody wants to say it. But people on the other team keep asking about the caching layer, right.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-28T09:02:07.227000Z",
