    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Kofi Mensah"
      },
      "text": "Right, and I'm not convinced the monorepo tooling is more of a people problem, more or less. Also, a couple of folks on support mentioned the logging format after standup, so like it's on people's radar. Plus I'm not convinced the Slack thread thread is fine in theory and stuff.",
