      "end_time": "2026-09-28T09:03:18.357000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, when I looked at the action items for this, nobody's really touched it in a while. Mm, I'd love to loop in the other team, but the feedback is not urgent. So it's like, like the scope is the obvious next thing you know, and nobody wants to say it. But honestly the preview environments only needs 20 minutes if we keep it behind a flag.",
