      "end_time": "2026-09-28T09:03:41.290000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Kim"
      },
      "text": "Oh, interesting.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-28T09:03:35.250000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-28T09:03:35.850000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "microphone"
      },
      "text": "I feel like my worry with the timeline is the dependencies on other teams. Like, it's like less about the service boundaries and more about the incident review, too be honest",
