    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker",
        "name": "Alex Kim"
      },
      "text": "A few managers keep asking about the on-call handoff, at least for now. Actually, that's basically what we saw with the priority list on this. Real quick, it's like like, the database indexes is under control and nobody wants to say it. Funny enough, the pagination bug took like two days last time. And part of me wants to loop in the other team, part of me thinks it's in a weird spot.",
